  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Santacruz East known for?",
      "answer": "Santacruz East is known for the Mumbai University Kalina campus, its proximity to BKC (Bandra Kurla Complex) and the domestic airport, the Kalina and Vakola residential pockets, the Air India and government colonies, and being a fast-developing commercial-residential hub on the Western Express Highway."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "Santacruz East primarily uses pin code 400055, with parts of the Kalina and Vakola belt also covered under 400029 and 400098."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Santacruz East are Kalina, Vakola, Mumbai University (Kalina campus), Air India Colony, Sunder Nagar, Vakola Bridge, Datta Mandir Road and the Western Express Highway belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Santacruz East range from around ₹1.2–1.8 Cr for a 1BHK in the Vakola/Kalina belt to ₹2–3.2 Cr for a 2BHK, with premium BKC-facing and newer towers commanding higher rates. Rental rates range from ₹35,000 to ₹85,000 per month depending on the sub-area and flat size (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "Santacruz East is served by Santacruz Station on the Western Line (about 25 min to Churchgate), with direct access to the Western Express Highway, BKC just minutes away, the domestic airport 5–10 minutes away, BEST buses, and proximity to Metro Line 3 (BKC) and Metro Line 1."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals in and near Santacruz East include V.N. Desai Municipal Hospital, Asian Heart Institute (BKC) nearby, and several nursing homes and clinics across the Kalina and Vakola belt, with Nanavati and Hinduja hospitals a short drive away."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools and colleges are in Santacruz East?",
      "answer": "Santacruz East is home to the University of Mumbai (Kalina campus), along with schools like Air India Modern School, Holy Family High School, St. Anthony's and several SSC and CBSE schools across Kalina and Vakola."
    },
    {
